sec.p:
Our findings support cautious optimism for several augmentation strategies;
although considering the high prevalence of TRD, evidence remains inadequate
for each treatment option.

fn.p:
When removing Fava et al. (2016), which employed a higher dose and
longer duration, heterogeneity reduced to 0% as did ES (0.64;
SE = 0.09; 95% CI: 0.46–0.82).
